          "description": "A house is a chosen family. Many members had been put out by queer-phobic biological families, and the house gave them shelter, guidance and a name to compete under. It is led by a mother and/or father, who decide who joins and who teach members about ballroom and about life. Houses are named after fashion labels or ideas — Willi Ninja said the House of Ninja \"hit hard and hit fast\". Members take the house name as their surname.",
