          "description": "At a ball the commentator calls categories one at a time and competitors walk in front of a panel of three or five judges. Judges give tens across the board to pass someone into the battles, and \"chop\" anyone who misses a requirement or falls. The final winner takes the grand prize. Kiki balls are the youth scene: lower stakes, often a first step for new voguers.",
          "tips": [
