          "summary": "What you walk in: runway, face, realness, performance, vogue and more, each with its own rules.",
          "description": "Every ball is organised into categories, and each has rules the judges score against. There are runway categories, realness categories, face, hand performance and sex siren, and the vogue categories: Old Way, New Way and Vogue Fem. Categories are also split by who walks them — butch queen, femme queen, female figure and so on. Teachers explain that newer names such as female figure performance were created to include more people without erasing the femme queens the categories were built around.",
