          "description": "Hand performance is storytelling with the hands, and it is where musicality shows most clearly: the hands can catch the detail of the beat that the walks can't. Gravity Balmain breaks it into five techniques: taps, lines, waves, circles and figure eights. It sits under everything in Vogue Fem and appears in Old Way and New Way too.",
